playbill bill wall~
A playbill, freshly pasted:

            THE LYCEUM, SOUTHWALL ROAD, ELRHINN

     Every evening but the Day of the Moon, curtain at the 7th hour
     of the evening.  On the Day of the Great Gods and the Day of
     the Sun, a matinee at the 2nd hour of the afternoon and a late
     performance at the 9th hour of the evening.

     Tickets at the box office.  Ask Madame Orsolya what is playing
     tonight (LIST), and BUY a TICKET.

     The management asks patrons NOT to brawl in the auditorium.
