#3604
The Prop Room~
   Shelves to the ceiling hold a lifetime of make-believe: wooden swords,
paste jewels, papier-mache skulls, a stuffed owl, a throne made of painted
crates.  It is very dusty, and something has been gnawing the corner of a
painted shield.  In the middle of the floor is a trapdoor with an iron
ring, once used to make demons rise through the stage; it has been nailed
shut, and somebody has pulled the nails out again.  The wings are east.
~
