#3605
The Cellar Beneath the Stage~
   A low brick cellar under the boards of the stage.  Light falls in
stripes between the planks above, and you can hear every footstep made up
there.  Old machinery rusts in the dark: a winch for the trap, a wooden
drum for thunder, a trough of sand for rain.  Droppings cover the floor,
and a hole has been gnawed clean through the east wall, into a tunnel.
The trapdoor is above you.
~
