#3607
An Old Scenery Store~
   A vault where the theatre once stored its scenery, long forgotten.  The
painted flats have slumped into a heap of rotting canvas, and the rats
have made tunnels through it.  A crowned king painted on one flat stares
out with a single gnawed eye.  The way out is north.
~
