#3608
A Junction of Tunnels~
   Three tunnels meet beneath a brick dome, and the sound of water and
scratching echoes in from all of them.  An old iron grate in the roof lets
in a little grey light from the street - you can see boots passing over
it.  Tunnels lead west, east and south.
