#3612
The Throne of the Rat King~
   A round chamber heaped with stolen things: buttons, spoons, candle ends,
paste jewels from the prop room, a single satin shoe.  On top of the heap,
on a throne of gnawed bones and gilt paper, squats the court of the rats.
The only way out is west.
~
